# Raw input datasets under resources/: the multi-GB production dumps are NOT
# tracked (BOLD_Public*, UNITE_public*, *_fasta_and_taxonomy.zip, PLANiTS_*, ...).
# Only the small mini_* test set and personal_test.fasta stay in git.
!resources/
resources/**
!resources/**/
!resources/**/mini_*
!resources/PERSONAL/personal_test.fasta
.attic/
.git-worktrees/

# Contributed test data is kept out of this public repository until its author
